\newlabel{fig:sigmanll}{{3}{9}{Left: the three NLLs against competitive reach. Right: the router's margin over the generalist. The oracle is nearly flat while the router is not, so reach controls how much specialisation the router can use rather than how much the specialists have}{figure.3}{}}
